       be determined using aaiioo__eerrrroorr(3).  When an operation has completed, its
       return  status can be obtained using aaiioo__rreettuurrnn(3).  Individual I/O op‐
       erations  can  fail  for  the  reasons  described  in  aaiioo__rreeaadd(3)  and
       aaiioo__wwrriittee(3).

